flowchart TB
    b([Browser])
    sf[storefront]
    gw[api-gateway]
    os[order-service]
    cs[cart-service]
    is[inventory-service]
    ps[payment-service]
    k[(Kafka)]
    b -->|1 POST /checkout| sf
    sf -->|2 POST /api/v1/orders + Idempotency-Key| gw
    gw -->|3 admission, then route| os
    os -->|4 GET checkout-snapshot| cs
    os -->|5 POST /internal/reservations| is
    os -->|6 POST /internal/payments/authorize| ps
    os -->|7 POST reservations/id/commit| is
    os -->|8 POST payments/id/capture| ps
    os -->|9 commit CONFIRMED + outbox row| os
    os -.->|10 order.events OrderConfirmed| k
    k -.->|11 clear cart| cs
    k -.->|11 email, analytics, recommendations| b2[notification, analytics, recommendation]
